  lectureTitle: Farming System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ce675b331a614e4a8eacab376672f33, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Farming System where the player can have a Land Plot, then
    by interacting with it they can select what seeds to plant, then by watering
    the Land Plot the seeds will grow from stage to stage.


    In this Scenario,
    the player can pick up Banana and Apple seeds, plant them, water the crops and
    harvest the fully grown trees.'
